\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs24\b Langou Input Method Privacy Policy\b0\par
Effective date: July 29, 2026\par
\par
Offline typing: Weasel and RIME typing, local dictionaries, and learned word frequencies stay on this computer. Offline typing remains available without an account, network, or AI service.\par
\par
Optional AI suggestions: When automatic AI is enabled, Langou Assistant may read visible text from supported chat applications through Windows UI Automation. It redacts and segments the text before sending it over HTTPS to api.langou.tech and the disclosed MiMo model provider. Suggestions are only inserted after the user clicks one and are never sent automatically.\par
\par
Local OCR: If UI Automation cannot provide trustworthy text, Langou Assistant may capture the active window in memory and run PP-OCRv6 locally. Screenshots are never uploaded or saved and are released immediately after recognition. Password fields, banking and payment programs, password managers, protected windows, and secure desktops are never captured.\par
\par
Account and retention: Phone numbers are sent to Alibaba Cloud SMS only for one-time login verification. If cloud AI history is enabled, redacted context and suggestions are encrypted and kept for no more than 30 days. Users can disable future saving or delete cloud history immediately. Anonymous diagnostics are disabled by default and never include chat text.\par
\par
Choices: After installation, open Langou Input Method Settings to independently disable automatic AI, cloud history, or anonymous diagnostics. Uninstallation removes local sensitive state.\par
\par
Full policy: https://langou.tech/en/privacy.html\par
Contact: privacy@langou.tech\par
